invariant: INV-65
file: test/x25519_adx_model.h
catches: diff_x25519_adx
reason: adx_mul_a24 multiplies by 121665, RFC 7748's a24, where the ladder
  in its OpenSSL order adds the product to BB and so needs 121666. The
  model is what the assembly is held to, word for word. bin/diff_x25519_adx
  holds the model to spec/lean/Spec/X25519Adx.lean's mulA24, whose proofs
  mulA24_lt and mulA24_mod are what make the Lean bounds a proof about this
  file.

--- old
        t += ct_mul128(a[i], 121666);
--- new
        t += ct_mul128(a[i], 121665);
